Read `AGENTS.md` for repository conventions.

This public repository owns the self-hostable runtime and published app contracts.
Hosted-only billing lifecycle and infrastructure enforcement belong in the hosted
lane. Stop before writing that code and ask to continue in the appropriate project.
For work spanning both lanes, implement the general runtime extension or capability
patch here and hand off hosted wiring after an OSS release. Never include private
repository names, code, or infrastructure identifiers here. Self-hosters get no
hosted gates.
